<title>FRANCE: EU 1996 grain crop may reach 194 mln tonnes - AGPM.</title>
<headline>EU 1996 grain crop may reach 194 mln tonnes - AGPM.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain industry and trade sources estimate the European Union's grain harvest may reach 194 million tonnes in 1996, the French maize growers association AGPM said on Monday.</p>
<p>In its September newsletter due for release later this week, AGPM said this would represent a rise of some 16 million tonnes from a recently revised 1995 crop of 178 million tonnes.</p>
<p>AGPM linked the sharp rise mostly to a 10.5 million tonne jump in the Spanish grain crop for 1996 after drought reduced the 1995 harvest to 11.5 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
